timestamp=2026-11-04T19:41:05.219Z level=INFO run=90d54173 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="cat >> /app/answer.py << 'PY'\n\ndef median(vals):\n    v = sorted(vals)\n    n = len(v)\n    if n % 2 == 1:\n        return v[n // 2]\n    return (v[n // 2 - 1] + v[n // 2]) / 2.0\n\ndef mad(vals, med):\n    if len(vals) == 0:\n        return 0.0\n    devs = [abs(x - med) for x in vals]\n    return median(devs)\n\ndef compute_net(base_amount, adj_pct, fee, waive):\n    if math.isnan(base_amount):\n        return float('nan')\n    if waive:\n        return 0.0\n    net = base_amount * (1.0 + adj_pct) + fee\n    return net\nPY" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
